  "description": "Dependency-only compatibility meta-package for the Datadog iOS SDK bindings. dd-sdk-ios 3.0 removed the DatadogObjc framework and moved its DD* types into the product modules, so this package now just pulls in DatadogNet.Core.iOS, DatadogNet.RUM.iOS, DatadogNet.Logs.iOS, DatadogNet.Trace.iOS and DatadogNet.SessionReplay.iOS. Namespaces changed with the move, so code needs updating - see the migration table in the README. New apps should reference the product modules directly.",
